{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03153",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.23,
      "end_seconds": 5.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I came as soon as they called me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.64,
      "end_seconds": 11.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.24,
      "end_seconds": 26.25,
      "duration_seconds": 13.01,
      "text": "ah, mainly blurred vision there's a couple of other things, but that's the main one my family kept telling me to get it checked"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.61,
      "end_seconds": 29.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.75,
      "end_seconds": 41.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.75,
      "text": "Around five days... no wait, it's more like three days. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.99,
      "end_seconds": 50.69,
      "duration_seconds": 8.7,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. What about a splash of cleaning fluid in your eye, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.59,
      "end_seconds": 56.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Yeah, I've had that that since last Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.63,
      "end_seconds": 67.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "now some background about your lifestyle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.41,
      "end_seconds": 79.03,
      "duration_seconds": 10.62,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.88,
      "end_seconds": 100.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.81,
      "end_seconds": 107.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, yes, I'm allergic to naproxen"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.76,
      "end_seconds": 114.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.81,
      "end_seconds": 123.66,
      "duration_seconds": 7.85,
      "text": "Gliclazide, 80 milligrams, twice a day. I didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.41,
      "end_seconds": 146.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "Alright, what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.62,
      "end_seconds": 157.75,
      "duration_seconds": 10.13,
      "text": "I have diabetes, for about ten years. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.77,
      "end_seconds": 162.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "any both eyes or head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.01,
      "end_seconds": 168.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "No both eyes or head injury, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.16,
      "end_seconds": 171.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "So, how's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.12,
      "end_seconds": 173.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.58,
      "end_seconds": 180.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "now I'm going to do a short physical check"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.2,
      "end_seconds": 183.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.06,
      "end_seconds": 186.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "So, does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.21,
      "end_seconds": 211.85,
      "duration_seconds": 8.64,
      "text": "The eye is very red with a cloudy cornea and the pH of the tears is very high."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.92,
      "end_seconds": 229.03,
      "duration_seconds": 14.11,
      "text": "So, that's all I needed to check. Taking everything into account, I don't have a clear answer today: an alkali chemical burn to the eye is possible, and so is a corneal abrasion."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.35,
      "end_seconds": 233.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.53,
      "end_seconds": 245.33,
      "duration_seconds": 10.8,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like an alkali chemical burn to the eye, but I'd like to confirm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.79,
      "end_seconds": 277.97,
      "duration_seconds": 15.18,
      "text": "We should do an urgent eye assessment for chemical eye injury. I'm going to put you on sterile saline irrigation, 2 litres, continuous, until pH neutral. That should help with chemical eye burn."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.91,
      "end_seconds": 282.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "how soon will it work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.52,
      "end_seconds": 299.98,
      "duration_seconds": 16.46,
      "text": "I am washing the eye now, keep it open and do not stop. If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently. Let's review you straight away. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.69,
      "end_seconds": 302.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
}